    // deep_tail_recursion: the idiomatic `.match`+recursion loop — a self-tail-recursive count to depth
    // 1,000,000 (well past the ~250k -O0 stack cliff), running only because the driver builds with
    // `-O1 -foptimize-sibling-calls` so cc eliminates the tail frame. Prints the accumulated 1000000.
    // (deep_nontail_recursion's stack-overflow panic is asserted in the `build shell` suite below.)
    // a `(` opening a NEW LINE is its own statement (no glue onto the previous `b := id`).
    // a statement-initial `.Okv(y)` after a call statement is the trailing expression, not a chain.
    // @addr/@load raw-memory intrinsics (the `@` spelling): @load(@addr(41)) + 1 = 42.
    // a single program imports a collection (vec) AND formatted output (fmt) and prints.
    // examples/stats.zen — the Goal-U capstone: vec stats printed via std.text.fmt.
    // examples/actor_demo.zen — actor ergonomics proof: builds, runs, prints its stats.
